    "description": "Welcome to TenderU \u2013 your gateway to global connections!\r\nAre you tired of meeting new people in the same old ways? Looking for a fun, innovative and safe way to expand your social circle? Look no further! TenderU will revolutionize the way you connect with others.\r\n\r\nDiscover the magic of TenderU:\r\n1) Meet new people every day\r\n2) Live videos with beauty filters\r\n3) Meet people from all over the world\r\n4) Privacy is important to you and us, make new friends safely\r\n5) Many gifts to express your friendship\r\n\r\nWhy choose TenderU?\r\n\u3010Easy Experience\u3011: Our app is designed for seamless chatting and making friends, allowing you to easily find new friends and connect with them.\r\n\u3010Fast Friends\u3011: Use our advanced tagging system to find people who are passionate about the same things as you, and quickly make like-minded friends!\r\n\r\nJoin the TenderU family today! Embark on a journey of making new friends, gaining unforgettable experiences, and start connecting with great people from all over the world.",
